[
    [
        {
            "type": "doc_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.302,
                0.052,
                0.698,
                0.076
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2026 届高三数学第一次模拟考试"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.369,
                0.09,
                0.63,
                0.108
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "满分 150 分 考试时间 120 分钟",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.064,
                0.142,
                0.439,
                0.163
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "一、选择题（每小题5分，共40分）"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.064,
                0.179,
                0.748,
                0.229
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 已知集合 \\(A = \\{x \\mid x^2 - 3x + 2 \\leqslant 0\\}\\), \\(B = \\{x \\mid x > 1\\}\\), 则 \\(A \\cap B = A\\) (1, 2) B. [1, 2] C. (1, 2] D. [1, 2)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.064,
                0.25,
                0.733,
                0.3
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 若复数 \\(z\\) 满足 \\(z(1 + i) = 2i\\)，则 \\(|z| = A.1\\) B. \\(\\sqrt{2}\\) C. 2 D. \\(2\\sqrt{2}\\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.064,
                0.32,
                0.723,
                0.369
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 函数 \\( f(x) = \\sin(2x + \\pi/3) \\) 的最小正周期为\nA. \\( \\pi/2 \\) B. \\( \\pi \\) C. \\( 2\\pi \\) D. \\( 4\\pi \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.064,
                0.399,
                0.439,
                0.42
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "二、填空题（每小题5分，共20分）"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.065,
                0.437,
                0.652,
                0.457
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 函数 \\( f(x) = \\sqrt{(x - 1)} / (x - 3) \\) 的定义域为 ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.063,
                0.478,
                0.631,
                0.499
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "5. 已知 \\(\\sin \\theta + \\cos \\theta = 1/2\\)，则 \\(\\sin 2\\theta =\\) ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.064,
                0.527,
                0.299,
                0.549
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "三、解答题（共60分）"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.064,
                0.567,
                0.61,
                0.587
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "6. 已知数列 \\(\\{a_{n}\\}\\) 满足 \\(a_1 = 1, a_{n+1} = 2a_n + 1 (n \\in N*)\\).",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.1,
                0.597,
                0.445,
                0.616
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "（1）证明：数列  \\( \\{a_{n} + 1\\} \\)  是等比数列；",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.101,
                0.625,
                0.366,
                0.645
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2) 求数列  \\( \\{a_{n}\\} \\)  的通项公式.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.065,
                0.67,
                0.448,
                0.688
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "7. 已知函数 \\( f(x) = x^3 - 3ax^2 + 3x + 1 \\).",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.099,
                0.697,
                0.701,
                0.716
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "（1）当 \\(a = 1\\) 时，求曲线 \\(\\mathbf{y} = \\mathbf{f}(\\mathbf{x})\\) 在点（1，f(1)）处的切线方程；",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.101,
                0.724,
                0.684,
                0.744
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "（2）若 \\( f(x) \\) 在区间（0，+∞）上单调递增，求实数 \\( a \\) 的取值范围.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.065,
                0.775,
                0.137,
                0.795
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "答题卡",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
